s surrounding the vaccines  i do because the law is not real clear  on this  when it's not a final uh approved  medical treatment uh normally that takes  about you know three to five years for  any type of new medicine or vaccine to  be fully approved  what we have now is just uh vaccines  rolling out under an emergency  uh provision uh because then they need  to  to be out before there's been long term  uh  investigation and studies on the all of  the effects  because of this uh it the vaccine  doesn't have the same  protections and rights as a medicine  or a vaccine that's been fully vetted  and fully approved  so for this reason the law is not too  clear and i'm sure we're going to see  a lot of contention and a lot of  lawsuits going back and forth  by employees that have been terminated  for not receiving the vaccine  or maybe even employees that have been  forced to take the vaccine and have some  about  somehow been affected yeah it is the  next chapter eric thank you  so much for your time appreciate it  always  thanks for having me great conversation  there for more information give eric  palacios and associates a call at  702-444-7777

